OL,3,AMen lose appeal for harassing BBC
OL,4,Ajournalist over A Very British Cult
OL,5,Adocumentary
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree men have lost their appeal for
OL,8,Fharassing BBC journalist Catrin Nye,
OL,9,Fwho presented the podcast series and
OL,10,Fdocumentary, A Very British Cult.
OL,12,FKristofer Deichler, 47, Jatinder Kamra,
OL,13,F46 and Sukhraj Singh, were sentenced
OL,14,Ffor harassment after visiting her home
OL,15,Fwhere she lived with her partner and
OL,16,Fchildren, first in a group in August
OL,17,F2024, and then again as the three of
OL,18,Fthem in September 2024.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
