OL,3,AMen lose appeal for harassing BBC
OL,4,Ajournalist over A Very British Cult
OL,5,Adocumentary
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We accept she was terrified by the
OL,8,Funexpected attendance" at her home,
OL,9,Fsaid Judge Pounder at Snaresbrook Crown
OL,10,FCourt, adding there was "heightened
OL,11,Fconcern" as her children were also
OL,12,Fhome.
OL,14,FAll three men are members of
OL,15,FLighthouse, which was investigated for
OL,16,Fthe 2023 documentary and podcast
OL,17,Ffronted by Nye.
